    "name": "Swagger PetStore API",
    "description": "Postman collection for the Swagger PetStore v2 API (https://petstore.swagger.io).\n\nFolders 1-3 run end-to-end in order (create \u2192 read \u2192 update \u2192 delete \u2192 negative checks) using generated test data stored in collection variables.\nFolder 4 is data-driven: run it in the Collection Runner with petstore_test_data.json or petstore_test_data.csv.",
